s her upper body slightly toward the opening as her hair settles. The camera pushes in with small amplitude toward the newly opened passage, ending with <Subject 1> in the foreground and the expansive tropical world clearly visible beyond the broken edges of <Subject 2>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA soft indoor room tone and faint air movement establish the initial space. The kick produces one dense wall impact followed by sharp cracking, falling plaster and masonry fragments, then a subtle transition into distant tropical water, light coastal wind, and faint palm-leaf movement coming through the opening.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA restrained cinematic score begins with low sustained strings and a sparse pulse, then introduces a bright rising orchestral shimmer and soft percussion at the moment the paradise is revealed, ending on a sustained luminous chord.",
